title: XenServer / XCP-ng: VM state
agents: xenserver
catalog: app/citrix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk

description:
 This check monitors the power state of a VM (piggyback data of the special
 agent {agent_xenserver}). By default Running, Halted and Suspended are {OK}, Paused is
 {WARN}; the states are configurable, e.g. to alert on VMs that must always
 run. Uptime, vCPUs, memory, guest OS, IP addresses, HA restart priority and
 the host the VM runs on are shown.

discovery:
 One service {XenServer VM} per VM.
